{"kind":"stack","id":"s-reversible","title":"Reversible changes: dissolving, mixing and changes of state","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f4","foreground":"#1d3b22","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Sugar dissolves in water. Can you get the sugar back?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Yes, by letting the water evaporate","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"No, the sugar is destroyed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"No, the sugar turns into water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Dissolving"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"When a solid mixes into a liquid and disappears from view, but can be got back by evaporating the liquid."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Ice melts into water when warmed. What is this change of state called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Melting","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Freezing","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Burning","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which change can be reversed by cooling?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Water turning into ice","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Baking a cake","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Burning paper","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Aoife stirs salt into a glass of water. The salt vanishes. She wants to get the salt back. What should she do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Heat the water so it evaporates","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Pour the water down the sink","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The water evaporates and white salt crystals are left in the glass. The change was reversible."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The salty water goes down the sink. The salt is lost, so Aoife cannot get it back."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Milk and cocoa powder are stirred together. Can the powder be separated from the milk again?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Yes, mixing is reversible","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"No, the cocoa is used up","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"No, the milk changes colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which change is NOT reversible?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Burning a piece of wood","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Melting chocolate","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Dissolving sugar in tea","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Water vapour cools and turns back into liquid water. What is this called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Condensation","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Evaporation","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Freezing","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the reversible changes quiz"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. Many changes can be undone, but burning cannot. Keep looking for changes around you."}],"actions":[]}}
